 * The ability has two main components:
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|1|21px]]
*** [[File:Dota2 Void Spirit Dissimilate Formation icon-0.png|168px|]] {{Symbol|Facing Angle|r}}
**** Creates 1 portal [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|21px|O]] at Inai's current location upon cast, the other {{#var:Dissimilate value3}} subsequent portals [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|21px|P]] , [[File:Dota2 Letter-q.png|21px|Q]] , [[File:Dota2 Letter-r.png|21px|R]] ,[[File:Dota2 Letter-s.png|21px|S]] ,  [[File:Dota2 Letter-a.png|21px|A]] , and [[File:Dota2 Letter-b.png|21px|B]] , are created in a [[wikipedia:hexagon|hexagon]]-shaped formation.
**** All {{#var:Dissimilate value3}} outer portals have the same distance to portal [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|21px|O]] .
***** {{Code|OP {{=}} OQ {{=}} OR {{=}} OS {{=}} OA {{=}} OB {{=}} {{#var:Dissimilate value2}}}}
***** {{Code|∠ POQ {{=}} ∠ QOR {{=}} ∠ ROS {{=}} ∠ SOA {{=}} ∠ AOB {{=}} ∠ BOP {{=}} {{#expr:360/{{#var:Dissimilate value3}}}}°}}
*** {{cf|talnotes}}
**** The {{ValueColor||outer ring portals|20tal}} {{M|talent|t=t3r}} creates {{ValueColor||{{#var:Dissimilate type1 value2 tal}}|20tal}} additional portals [[File:Dota2 Letter-t.png|21px|T]] extending behind the first ring portals.
**** [[File:Dota2 Void Spirit Dissimilate Formation icon-1.png|168px|]][[File:Dota2 Void Spirit Dissimilate Formation icon-2.png|168px|]]
***** Each outer ring has the same distance.
****** {{Code|OT {{=}} OT' {{=}} {{ValueColor||{{#var:Dissimilate type1 value1 tal}}|tal|x}}}}
***** Has the same angles as the first ring portals.
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|2|21px]] {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*** Can still pick up items or {{A|Runes|Activate|text=Activate Runes}} at the cast location, portal [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|21px|O]].
*** Applies the following ability effects on Inai upon cast:
**** {{M|Disarm}}
**** {{M|Hidden}}
**** {{M|Invulnerable}}
**** {{M|Mute}}
**** {{M|Root}}
**** {{M|Silence}}
*** [[File:Dota2 RMB.png|21px|Right-click]]
**** Can choose its reappearing portal with any issued order, with the closest portal to the right-clicked location selected.
**** The selected portal can be changed as many times as needed while Inai is {{M|hidden}}.
**** {{Symbol|fx|v}}
***** The selected portal is visually highlighted ally-only.
*** {{Symbol|Teleport}}
**** {{#var:Dissimilate value5}} seconds after casting, the ability [[teleport]]s Inai to the selected portal.
**** Does not {{M|disjoint}} incoming {{M|projectiles}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Dissimilate icon0}}
| desc = Void Spirit temporarily fades into the aether, creating a number of portals through which he can reassemble himself. Upon exiting a portal, he damages all enemies in the area.
}}
* {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
** The ability effects are applied as follows on the selected portal's radius upon reappearing:
**# The {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}}.
**# {{Symbol|bonus t4l}} {{Symbol|Root}} {{Symbol|Modifier|debuff}} {{Code|rooted}}.

